  "description": {
    "text": "Japanese basic Energy cards of the LEGEND era, with a ©2009 line and no set symbol or number. Each type has its own background art, a Pokémon silhouette against a landscape, and the card prints its name, as Japanese basic Energy has done since this era. One came in every booster pack of HeartGold Collection and SoulSilver Collection, released on 9 October 2009 as the first LEGEND era expansions; English HeartGold & SoulSilver numbered the same designs 115-122/123.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: HeartGold & SoulSilver (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 22 July 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260722103728/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/HeartGold_Collection_(TCG)"
      },
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: SVE Basic Energies (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 15 July 2026)",
